# Orca screen reader keys for the sway session (regolith-sway-screen-reader).
# On Wayland Orca can't grab keys, so sway binds the Orca key (Insert or keypad
# Insert), Orca+key chords and the keypad review keys, and runs each command
# through Orca's remote controller (Orca 49 or later). The bindings are only
# there while the screen reader is on in Settings > Accessibility and Orca is
# running; otherwise every key reaches applications as usual. The X11 session
# doesn't need this: Orca grabs its keys there itself.
exec regolith-sway-screen-reader
